 "context": [
  {
   "h": "Venus and Psyche",
   "body": "<p>Cupid reminds Psyche of something she did not know: his mother Venus had ordered him to make her fall in love with the most wretched of men, as punishment for drawing worshippers away from the goddess. Instead he disobeyed his mother and became her husband himself. Venus' anger, and the trials she will set Psyche, drive the rest of the story.</p>"
